{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:09 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:09 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:09 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"美容美髮店遭淋油，警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/600f80d7a73c037a64b7f6d5bf3b7386/2026-11/page_218.jpg\"/><p>深水埗福華街50號一間美容美髮店遭人淋潑油漆。今日（25日）早上9時55分，職員返回店舖準備開門營業時，赫見地舖遭人淋潑黑色油漆，於是報警。人員接報到場，所見美容美髮店的玻璃門和牆身都沾滿漆油，遂將案件列作刑事毀壞，追緝涉案歹徒。</p><img alt=\"店舖大門和牆身都染上黑色漆油。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8966b44a73495f7155be2c6cd44fd350/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_10_41_18.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/44b7326c77c3742ef373f7a251f01e27/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_10_41_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/80cd507ded86577c21609b209f14de63/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_10_41_20.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2fea3a08816235dee8443299d6952293/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_10_41_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/94adcb3140ce3554f38ab6212e0faf12/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_10_41_19_2_.jpeg\"/><p>涉事店舖的職員和業主向《星島頭條》表示沒有欠債，亦「冇人嚟收過保護費」，不明白事件原因。據了解，該美容美髮店開業約一年半，之前一直相安無事，惟過往鄰舖曾有人在美容店外範圍擺放枱凳及掛毛巾，影響做生意，美容店職員一度向對方交涉並作出勸喻，懷疑與淋油事件有關。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.087586+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:09:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:57:34.468828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:25.958363+00:00","content_hash":"85d9e108c2a42c53f9fe74447655eea0375574d290676c04a9d9a2a4084b1dfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}